  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Slice brown onion into thick wedges. Trim green beans.\n• Place onion and chopped pumpkin on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle over garlic seasoning. Drizzle with olive oil and toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 25-30 mins. In the last 10 minutes, add the green beans to the tray and return to the oven",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61846f464135a94b130f949e/step-96c8279a.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When veggies have 10 minutes remaining, bring a large saucepan of salted water to boil. Thinly slice sage leaves. Finely chop or crush garlic.\n• Add risoni and cook until ‘al dente’, 7-8 mins.\n• Drain and set aside in a medium bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61846f464135a94b130f949e/step-ed2702bc.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return saucepan to medium heat, melt butter.\n• Stir in sage and garlic until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in roast veggies, drained risoni, vegetable stock, baby spinach leaves and fetta. Season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61846f464135a94b130f949e/step-220b81f5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide risoni between bowls.\n• Sprinkle over chilli flakes (if using).",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61846f464135a94b130f949e/step-be3f3a57.jpg"
    }
  ]
